1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,970
Every forecast is a promise.

2
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:06,154
In Da Nang, it breaks.

3
00:00:06,854 --> 00:00:11,308
Last autumn, storms cancelled or postponed up to forty percent of tours.

4
00:00:11,558 --> 00:00:14,143
Apps tell you the wind. Never what to do.

5
00:00:15,193 --> 00:00:18,377
So we built something that doesn't just predict the weather.

6
00:00:18,577 --> 00:00:19,996
It decides.

7
00:00:21,946 --> 00:00:23,944
Ask the way you'd ask a colleague.

8
00:00:25,394 --> 00:00:27,569
Seven forecasts become one.

9
00:00:29,019 --> 00:00:32,221
Every answer is checked against real safety rules.

10
00:00:33,671 --> 00:00:36,490
When the storm moves in, your plan moves with it.

11
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:40,374
For the traveler. The builder. The farmer.

12
00:00:41,524 --> 00:00:44,502
Ninety-one percent of calls match the experts.

13
00:00:44,652 --> 00:00:46,780
A decision in under five seconds.

14
00:00:46,930 --> 00:00:48,711
Zero unsafe calls.

15
00:00:49,161 --> 00:00:52,362
Top ten at the Vietnam AI Open Hackathon.

16
00:00:53,512 --> 00:00:54,755
Weatherise.

17
00:00:55,055 --> 00:00:57,865
The best weather is the weather you planned for.
